      "message": "I think this branch can\u0027t run on a P3S kernel: `VM_GROWSUP` is only defined for `CONFIG_PARISC` (`include/linux/mm.h`), and everywhere else, arm64 included, it is `VM_NONE`, so the compiler drops this block. On parisc, `mm_pte_size()` is `PAGE_SIZE`, so nothing changes there either.\n\nAgreed it would be the matching value if the branch could run, but would it be OK to drop this patch, to keep the `include/linux/mm.h` diff minimal?",
